# HyprX package list
# One package per line. Comments start with #.

# Fonts
# Caudex isn't in the official repos or a small dedicated AUR
# package - ttf-google-fonts-git bundles Google's whole font
# catalog (confirmed via Google's own fonts repo, ofl/caudex),
# which is the standard way to get less-common Google Fonts on
# Arch. JetBrainsMono Nerd Font itself is assumed pre-installed
# (pre-existing gap, not introduced here - it was never in this
# list even though every UI font-family already depended on it).
ttf-google-fonts-git

